{"nodes": [{"id": "brain_knowledge_04_supervisor_evidence_pack_supervisor_evidence_pack", "label": "PRJ93 Supervisor Evidence Pack", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "brain/knowledge/04_supervisor_evidence_pack.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Artifacts were read before raw sources and the store was inspected directly rather than described from the brief, so every store figure is a live query result rather than a quotation."}, {"id": "brain_knowledge_04_supervisor_evidence_pack_neondb_never_provisioned", "label": "NeonDB Research Schema Never Provisioned", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "brain/knowledge/04_supervisor_evidence_pack.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The principal deviation from the specification is on the input side, not the output side, which is why infrastructure is a first-class row rather than a footnote."}, {"id": "brain_knowledge_04_supervisor_evidence_pack_duckdb_warehouse", "label": "Self-Assembled DuckDB + Parquet Warehouse", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "brain/knowledge/04_supervisor_evidence_pack.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Built to stand in for the missing research schema; the cost is that every result rests on a self-assembled corpus whose external validity is untested."}, {"id": "brain_knowledge_04_supervisor_evidence_pack_built_beyond_specification", "label": "Six Things Built Beyond the Specification", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "brain/knowledge/04_supervisor_evidence_pack.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Each was built because a specified input failed to arrive, which is where supervisory credit sits."}, {"id": "brain_knowledge_04_supervisor_evi